    lieutenant "我来这里的路上被人跟踪了。他们派了两个守卫跟着我，但我没能摆脱他们。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2705
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_6d670cf3:

    # renza "Fortunately, my men captured them before they could report back to the Guard office. But it's only a matter of time before someone notices their disappearance."
    renza "幸好我的手下在他们向卫兵办公室报告之前就抓住了他们。但他们的失踪只是时间问题，迟早会有人发现的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2708
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_dc61fc99:

    # lieutenant "And when they do... Whoever sent them will know that they were right to suspect me."
    lieutenant "当他们真的这么做的时候……派他们来的人就会知道，他们怀疑我是对的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2710
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_4150d586:

    # you "Damn... You're in a tight spot."
    you "糟糕……你处境艰难了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2712
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_d7a1e664:

    # renza "We are... That's why I'd like to enlist your help."
    renza "我们是……所以我想请你们帮忙。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2714
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_7e878ecb:

    # you "Me? What can I possibly do?"
    you "我？我能做什么呢？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2716
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_583862ef:

    # renza "We have captured the two officers. I want you to interrogate them."
    renza "我们已经抓获了这两名警官。我要你审问他们。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2718
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_47ec1c92:

    # you "Wait... Why me?"
    you "等等……为什么是我？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2720
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_dadc8676:

    # renza "Well, you're an experienced [MC.playerclass], aren't you? I'm sure you have some tricks up your sleeve."
    renza "嗯，你可是个经验丰富的[MC.playerclass]玩家啊，肯定还有不少绝招呢。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2722
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_7a734a58:

    # renza "They haven't seen us together yet. We think it's better if they don't meet face to face with me or the lieutenant. We can still recover from this fiasco if we keep them in the dark as much as we can."
    renza "他们还没见过我们在一起。我们觉得最好不要让他们和我或那位中尉见面。如果我们尽可能地瞒着他们，或许还能从这场闹剧中挽回局面。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2725
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_a3214c7e:

    # renza "But I'll interrogate them myself if I have to... And then I'll turn them into corpses. I couldn't let them go after they've seen me."
    renza "但如果必要的话，我会亲自审问他们……然后我会把他们变成尸体。他们见过我之后，我不能放他们走。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2728
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_1c43898e:

    # you "That's harsh."
    you "这太苛刻了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2730
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_7958f7c1:

    # renza "Maybe. So why don't you give it a try, before I have to dirty my hands?"
    renza "也许吧。那不如你先试试，免得我弄脏了手？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2732
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_78bbd330:

    # lieutenant "The two officers are sergeants in my squad."
    lieutenant "这两名警官是我小队的士官。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2734
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_ccca34b2:

    # renza "We captured them separately. It's almost like they were working on distinct assignments."
    renza "我们分别拍摄了他们的画面。他们好像在执行不同的任务一样。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2736
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_808e5024:

    # lieutenant "They're in the cells at the end of the corridor. Their names are Maya and Kashiv."
    lieutenant "他们被关在走廊尽头的牢房里。他们的名字叫玛雅和卡什夫。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2740
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_05839a71:

    # you "Maya?"
    you "玛雅？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2742
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_fee099b0:

    # you "Wait a minute!"
    you "等一下！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2745
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_2a6460dc:

    # renza "What?" nointeract
    renza "What?" nointeract

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2749
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_1781ca95:

    # you "I know Maya. No need to interrogate her. She's not involved in the Guard's corruption."
    you "我认识玛雅。没必要审问她。她没有参与卫队的腐败活动。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2754
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_6a04c8ba:

    # lieutenant "Oh? And what makes you so sure?"
    lieutenant "哦？你凭什么这么肯定？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2756
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_04434417:

    # you "She defended me with another guard when I was under attack by some street thugs. I'm pretty sure they were corrupted guards in disguise. She's clean, she must be."
    you "我被几个街头混混袭击时，她和另一个保镖保护了我。我非常肯定那些混混是伪装的腐败保镖。她很清白，肯定没问题。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2759
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_b696a57c:

    # lieutenant "It's true that she was always quite the righteous one..."
    lieutenant "她的确一直是个非常正直的人……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2761
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_c3dce49a:

    # renza "Anyway, she's still a security risk. I'll need to keep her locked up until the coast is clear."
    renza "总之，她仍然构成安全隐患。在安全得到保障之前，我需要把她关起来。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2763
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_bb02a459:

    # lieutenant "I guess we need to focus our efforts on Kashiv, then. I always knew that bitch was up to something."
    lieutenant "看来我们得把精力集中在卡什夫身上了。我早就知道那个贱人肯定在密谋什么。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2765
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_65641483:

    # renza "Make sure to talk to Maya as well, though. She might know something."
    renza "不过，也别忘了跟玛雅谈谈。她或许知道些什么。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2767
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_9b255b07:

    # lieutenant "Use whatever means necessary to get Sergeant Kashiv to confess. We don't have time."
    lieutenant "不惜一切代价让卡什夫中士认罪。我们时间紧迫。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2773
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_336a8295:

    # renza "All right, it's settled, then. Go and question those bitch guards."
    renza "好了，就这么定了。去质问那些泼妇保安吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2775
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_9b42a4ec:

    # lieutenant "You can use any means necessary. Time is of the essence..."
    lieutenant "你可以不择手段。时间至关重要……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2777
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_b665277f:

    # you "Any means necessary?"
    you "不惜一切代价？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2779
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_9cfdce2f:

    # renza "That's right. I don't care what you have to do to these sorry sluts. Ram a stick up their ass if you have to. What the guards do when they catch one of our own is a hundred times worse."
    renza "没错。我不在乎你得对这些可怜的贱货做什么。就算要用棍子捅她们的屁股也行。守卫抓到我们自己人时所做的事情，比这糟糕一百倍。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2782
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_aca7e2b6:

    # you "I see... Let me handle this."
    you "我明白了……让我来处理。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2790
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_fa010d40:

    # "You head back to the main corridor in the thieves guild basement and walk down to the prisoner cells."
    "You head back to the main corridor in the thieves guild basement and walk down to the prisoner cells."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2792
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_5eda5f04:

    # "A thief guard is waiting for your orders."
    "A thief guard is waiting for your orders."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2794
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_4d6d2ce3:

    # "It is time to interrogate the prisoners. What will you do first?"
    "It is time to interrogate the prisoners. What will you do first?"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2806
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_4419f491:

    # "Leaving Maya's cell, you tell the guard that you will now visit the sergeant."
    "Leaving Maya's cell, you tell the guard that you will now visit the sergeant."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2818
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_6491a6b4:

    # "Exiting Maya's cell, you wipe the dust from your jacket. You tell the guard that you will now visit the sergeant."
    "Exiting Maya's cell, you wipe the dust from your jacket. You tell the guard that you will now visit the sergeant."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2830
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_56d49d27:

    # "Exiting Sergeant Kashiv's cell, you wipe the dust from your jacket. You tell the guard that you will now visit Maya's."
    "Exiting Sergeant Kashiv's cell, you wipe the dust from your jacket. You tell the guard that you will now visit Maya's."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2838
translate chinese_simplified c1_ask_guild_for_help_261877dd:

    # "Rendezvous with Renza at the {b}thieves guild{/b}."
    "Rendezvous with Renza at the {b}thieves guild{/b}."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2848
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_fcd2fdd8:

    # "You tell the guard that you will visit Maya. He opens the door for you."
    "You tell the guard that you will visit Maya. He opens the door for you."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2856
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_bd3fa1f6:

    # you "Hello, Maya."
    you "你好，玛雅。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2858
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_930a5633:

    # maya "Have you come to torture me? You won't get anything from me, scum."
    maya "你是来折磨我的吗？你休想从我这里得到任何东西，人渣。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2860
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_010b51e2:

    # maya "Wait, you look familiar..."
    maya "等等，你看上去很眼熟……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2864
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_fd7f6b13:

    # maya "You're the one Roz and I defended in an alley, some days ago! You were travelling with your pink hair slave..."
    maya "你就是几天前我和罗兹在小巷里保护的那个人！你当时带着你的粉头发奴隶……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2866
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_48d1cb92:

    # you "Your memory serves you well."
    you "你的记忆力很好。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2868
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_7f147149:

    # maya "If I had known you were a filthy thief, I would have left you there to rot! Leave me alone, you bastard!"
    maya "如果我知道你是个卑鄙的小偷，我早就把你扔在那儿烂掉！滚开，你这个混蛋！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2872
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_247777af:

    # you "Relax, I'm not here to hurt you. And I'm not with the thieves guild. For what it's worth, I defended you back there. Convinced them you were not a corrupted guard."
    you "别担心，我不是来伤害你的。我也不是盗贼公会的人。顺便说一句，我当时还保护了你，让他们相信你不是个腐败的守卫。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2875
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_6cb9f7fd:

    # "She scoffs."
    "She scoffs."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2877
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_f5aec7e3:

    # maya "A corrupted guard? What are you talking about? What do the thieves care about corruption?"
    maya "一个腐败的守卫？你在说什么？盗贼会在乎腐败吗？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2884
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_6c83771e:

    # you "The thieves have had enough with the Guard's harassment. They want to replace the current captain with one of their own."
    you "盗贼们受够了守卫的骚扰。他们想用自己人取代现任队长。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2886
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_a3504cf0:

    # maya "The lieutenant..."
    maya "中尉……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2888
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_675325eb:

    # you "Yes. You'd better keep it to yourself if you want to stay alive."
    you "是的。如果你想活命，最好还是把这件事藏在心里。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2892
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_70ddc422:

    # maya "We must not allow this to happen!" with vpunch
    maya "We must not allow this to happen!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2894
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_90884327:

    # you "What do you mean? Are you supporting the captain now?"
    you "你什么意思？你现在支持队长了吗？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2896
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_2491f33c:

    # maya "Oh, Arios no. I know how bad things have become lately, and I know the Captain is behind this."
    maya "哦，阿里奥斯，不。我知道最近情况变得有多糟糕，我也知道这一切都是船长在背后操纵的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2898
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_f61fb507:

    # maya "But a thieves guild puppet wouldn't be any better as a replacement."
    maya "但盗贼公会的傀儡作为替代品也好不到哪里去。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2900
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_0e26a5a5:

    # you "It's not like we have a lot of options here."
    you "我们在这里并没有太多选择。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2904
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_43410e2b:

    # maya "..."
    maya "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2906
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_04b6d1d1:

    # maya "Listen, I'm thankful that you told me the truth. I believe you when you say you're honest. So hear me out."
    maya "听着，我很感激你告诉我真相。我相信你说的诚实。所以，请听我说完。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2908
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_758e4436:

    # you "I'm listening."
    you "我在听。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2910
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_c50a5c64:

    # maya "Play along with the thieves as long as necessary. Do what you must to bring Captain Farah down."
    maya "尽可能长时间地配合盗贼们。不惜一切代价扳倒法拉船长。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2912
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_899487e3:

    # maya "But when the time comes to choose a new captain, you must expose the lieutenant as a thief spy. Do not let her become the head of the city guard."
    maya "但是，在选拔新队长的时候，你必须揭露那位副官是窃贼兼间谍。千万别让她当上城卫队队长。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2915
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_c6342493:

    # you "Mmh... That's a tall order. What's in it for me?"
    you "嗯……这要求可不低。我能从中得到什么好处呢？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2917
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_a6e35bfd:

    # maya "To do the right thing? For the citizens of the Slums?"
    maya "做正确的事？为了贫民窟的居民？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2919
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_3feecd2c:

    # you "Mmh..."
    you "嗯……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2921
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_fd6dc371:

    # maya "And of course, you would get the Guard's support in your business endeavors. Get you a proper business license, perhaps?"
    maya "当然，国民警卫队也会支持你的商业活动。比如，帮你办理正规的营业执照？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2923
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_1881675b:

    # you "That would help."
    you "那会有帮助。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2925
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_67b5c3dd:

    # maya "Promise me to think about it. And I'll tell you what I know."
    maya "答应我我会好好考虑一下。我会把我所知道的都告诉你。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2927
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_a97da945:

    # you "Okay, okay."
    you "好的，好的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2931
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_1a0c484b:

    # maya "Yes. Please, leave me now..."
    maya "是的，请你现在就离开我吧……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2933
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_d5cbf151:

    # you "Fine. Stay put."
    you "好的，就待在原地。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2939
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_59c245f8:

    # you "Well... They didn't say. But they want to expose the corruption in the Guard, so I'm sure you could find some common ground with them, if you tried."
    you "嗯……他们没说。但他们想揭露卫队内部的腐败，所以如果你努力的话，我相信你能和他们找到一些共同点。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2941
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_5dc92e4c:

    # maya "Common ground! With thieves! Have you come here to insult me!" with vpunch
    maya "Common ground! With thieves! Have you come here to insult me!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2943
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_d30ee5d5:

    # you "Calm down, it's not like that... Anyway, there is little you or I can do. They want information about the Guard's dealings. They suspect the captain."
    you "冷静点，事情不是你想的那样……总之，你我都无能为力。他们想要了解卫队的行动。他们怀疑是队长干的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2945
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_7382061b:

    # maya "Oh, how insightful of them. And this is all out of their good hearts, uh? *angry*"
    maya "哦，他们真是太有洞察力了。这一切都是出于好心，是吗？*生气*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2947
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_71f58603:

    # you "Help me out here, Maya. They are not patient people."
    you "玛雅，帮帮我。他们可没耐心。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2949
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_43410e2b_1:

    # maya "..."
    maya "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2951
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_1d4c99ea:

    # maya "Fine, I'll tell you what I know. It's mostly public knowledge, anyway."
    maya "好吧，我就把我知道的告诉你。反正大部分都是公开信息。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2953
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_2f80cca2:

    # maya "Not like I care what happens to the damn captain."
    maya "我才不在乎那个该死的船长会怎么样。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2957
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_05bc6d41:

    # maya "Yes... Please, leave me now... And think about what I said. Try to do the right thing."
    maya "是的……求你了，现在就离开我吧……好好想想我说的话。试着做正确的事。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2959
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_d5cbf151_1:

    # you "Fine. Stay put."
    you "好的，就待在原地。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2963
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_d3be706e:

    # you "Tall words, for someone in your situation. I've been sent here to make you talk."
    you "对你这种处境来说，说这种话未免太夸张了。我来这里就是为了让你开口。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2965
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_b5f92919:

    # maya "You ungrateful bastard! I saved your ass!"
    maya "你这个忘恩负义的混蛋！我救了你的命！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2967
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_26cc41e2:

    # you "I don't like your tone. Don't forget who's in charge now."
    you "我不喜欢你的语气。别忘了现在谁说了算。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2969
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_43410e2b_2:

    # maya "..."
    maya "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2971
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_8e661abe:

    # maya "I won't tell you anything. What are you going to do? Beat me? Torture me?"
    maya "我什么都不会告诉你。你想干什么？打我？折磨我？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:2973
translate chinese_simplified c1_maya_interrogation_88544750:

    # maya "Or..."
