    # captain "I also like jewels, of course. I have thousands of them! Oh, and fine clothes and lingerie... Do you know how much they charge for Hokoman silk? The sky's the limit!"
    captain "我当然也喜欢珠宝。我收藏了成千上万件！哦，还有漂亮的衣服和内衣……你知道霍克曼丝绸要多少钱吗？简直是天价！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5055
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_fc055125:

    # captain "And SHOES, of course. I have so many shoes!!! But I can never get enough... Shoes..."
    captain "当然还有鞋子！我有很多鞋子！！！但我永远都觉得不够……鞋子……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5057
