    captain "好了，你成功了。现在我明天一早就得去买一双漂亮的水晶鞋了。*叹气*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5065
translate chinese_simplified c1_captain_meeting_b871d1b5:

    # you "I see. Looks like you have lots of legitimate uses for this gold."
    you "我明白了。看来你有很多正当的黄金用途。"

