    kuro "那么你一定是个真正的英勇战士。国王的士兵中，能亲身经历那场战役并活着回来的人寥寥无几。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5964
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_c486ae6a:

    # maya "I have witnessed first-hand the treachery of both the Guard captain and lieutenant. In fact, she had me kidnapped by her friends in the guild. I don't know what cruel fate would have befell me if I didn't manage to escape in time."
    maya "我亲眼目睹了卫队长和副队长的背叛。事实上，是她指使公会里的朋友绑架了我。如果我没能及时逃脱，真不知道自己会遭遇怎样的悲惨命运。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5967
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_0d9e6191:

    # "The lieutenant hisses."
    "The lieutenant hisses."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5969
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_4a388f10:

    # lieutenant "We should have slit your throat when we had the chance, snake!!!" with vpunch
    lieutenant "We should have slit your throat when we had the chance, snake!!!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5971
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_e3c76918:

    # kuro "Judge! Arrest the corrupt lieutenant too."
    kuro "法官！把那个腐败的副官也逮捕了吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5975
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_e9397f4a:

    # lieutenant "No!!! I was so close... So close!!! Let me go!!!" with vpunch
    lieutenant "No!!! I was so close... So close!!! Let me go!!!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5977
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_4f64533c:

    # kuro "It seems to me that the ranking officers of the city guard were all corrupt beyond redemption. I do not trust any of them to take the helm now..."
    kuro "在我看来，城卫队的高级军官们都腐败透顶，无可救药。我现在不信任他们中的任何一个人来掌舵……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5979
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_e0f10ac0:

    # kuro "You! Veteran fighter! What did you say your rank in the Guard was?"
    kuro "你！老兵！你刚才说你在国民警卫队是什么军衔？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5981
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_fa2e3046:

    # maya "I... I am but a sergeant, your Highness."
    maya "我……我只是个中士，殿下。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5983
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_b67dbdc6:

    # kuro "That is good. Judge, bear witness to my royal command: you will make Sergeant Maya the Captain of the Guard, by order of the Crown."
    kuro "很好。法官，请见证我的皇家命令：奉王室之命，任命玛雅中士为卫队长。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5985
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_f4545d67:

    # judge "Of... Of course, your Highness!"
    judge "当然，殿下！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5987
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_7fc41f7b:

    # kuro "Captain, you are to root out all corruption from the city guard's midst."
    kuro "队长，你的任务是彻底清除城卫队中的所有腐败分子。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5989
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_1c8efe71:

    # maya "It... It is such an honor, your Highness!"
    maya "这……这真是我的荣幸，殿下！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5991
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_2d42b37d:

    # kuro "An honor that you didn't request, which is why I bestow it upon you. I will expect regular updates about your progress, captain. Any wrongs you discover, I will see to it myself that they are righted."
    kuro "这是你并未主动要求的荣誉，所以我才授予你。队长，我希望你定期汇报进展。如果你发现任何错误，我会亲自纠正。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5994
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_37b955f5:

    # maya "Your Highness... I will not disappoint you!"
    maya "殿下……我绝不会让您失望！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:5998
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_040bc795:

    # "The crowd cheers Maya's nomination."
    "The crowd cheers Maya's nomination."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6008
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_513a4214:

    # you "Long live the new captain!"
    you "新船长万岁！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6010
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_ffc8be93:

    # "The crowd chants alongside you, cheering the new captain's promotion."
    "The crowd chants alongside you, cheering the new captain's promotion."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6012
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_056f5d0a:

    # "You spot the lone figure of Maya in the crowd, looking at you with a disappointed look on her face."
    "You spot the lone figure of Maya in the crowd, looking at you with a disappointed look on her face."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6014
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_62f153c9:

    # "You shrug, and join the celebrations with your new friends."
    "You shrug, and join the celebrations with your new friends."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6017
translate chinese_simplified c1_trial_ff3aa127:

    # "You've made a powerful ally, today... And a powerful enemy. You hope it was the right choice."
    "You've made a powerful ally, today... And a powerful enemy. You hope it was the right choice."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6076
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_84ba729e:

    # guard "Hey, who are you?"
    guard "嘿，你是谁？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6082
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_9223a92c:

    # guard "Came to join the party?"
    guard "来参加聚会吗？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6084
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_ae181925:

    # you "Wow, you guys are enjoying yourself..."
    you "哇，你们玩得真开心啊……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6086
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_194cf6ad:

    # you "The name's [MC.name]. I came to see Maya."
    you "我的名字是[MC.name]。我是来看玛雅的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6088
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_d5b20412:

    # guard "Hey!" with vpunch
    guard "Hey!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6089
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_3d3a555d:

    # guard "It's Captain Maya to you, punk!"
    guard "你这小混蛋，叫我玛雅船长！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6091
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_7bffb1bd:

    # roz "[MC.name]!"
    roz "[MC.name]！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6104
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_0e3a1bef:

    # roz "Watch how you talk to my friend, rookies, or I'll have you clean the latrines 'til summer comes!"
    roz "菜鸟们，注意你们跟我朋友说话的语气，否则我就让你们一直打扫厕所到夏天！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6106
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_17b7463b:

    # guard "Ouch! Y... Yes Lieutenant!"
    guard "哎哟！是……是的，中尉！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6108
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_93fb4223:

    # roz "[MC.name], my man! Nice of you to show up for the party."
    roz "[MC.name]，我的兄弟！你来参加派对真是太好了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6110
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_3f475b25:

    # you "So she made you a lieutenant, uh?"
    you "所以她让你当了中尉，是吗？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6112
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_60398159:

    # roz "Of course! Who else could she trust in that position!"
    roz "当然！在这种职位上，她还能信任谁呢！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6114
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_86ff4112:

    # roz "Listen, ahem... I'm sorry I misjudged you earlier, [MC.name]. That was one hell of a public spanking you gave Captain Farrah! BWAHAHAHA!"
    roz "听着，咳咳……对不起，我之前误判你了，[MC.name]。你刚才当众打法拉船长的屁股可真够狠的！哈哈哈哈！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6116
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_daee8576:

    # you "Well, uh... Thanks..."
    you "嗯……谢谢……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6118
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_53585467:

    # roz "So, what are you doing here, [MC.name]? Eager to enlist with the rest of these rookies?"
    roz "所以，[MC.name]，你来这里做什么？是想和其他新兵一起入伍吗？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6120
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_f7f4d0e4:

    # you "No, Roz. I'm looking for Maya. Rooting the corruption from the city guard is nice and all, but I still need a proper license for my business."
    you "不，罗兹。我在找玛雅。清除城卫队的腐败固然重要，但我还需要一张正规的营业执照。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6122
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_5ce8072b:

    # roz "Oh, I see... Maya isn't much for parties, anyway. I think she's up in the captain office, planning the city guard's future, or some other similarly boring stuff..."
    roz "哦，我明白了……玛雅本来就不太喜欢参加派对。我想她应该在队长办公室里，筹划着城卫队的未来，或者做些其他类似的无聊事……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6125
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_ee49ba53:

    # you "Thanks, I'll show myself in, then. You... Enjoy whatever it is you're doing..."
    you "谢谢，那我这就进去。你……好好享受你正在做的事情吧……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6127
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_684267dc:

    # roz "Yay! Party time!"
    roz "耶！派对时间到！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6141
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_26cfff88:

    # maya "Yes?"
    maya "是的？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6149
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_f0b0549e:

    # you "Hi, Maya. How are things going?"
    you "嗨，玛雅。一切都好吗？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6151
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_dcfe2f8e:

    # maya "Oh, it's you, [MC.name]. I've only started to make changes to the way things are run here..."
    maya "哦，是你啊，[MC.name]。我才刚刚开始改变这里的运作方式……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6153
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_d98e12b5:

    # you "I saw a lot of new faces downstairs."
    you "我在楼下看到了很多新面孔。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6155
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_126c483f:

    # maya "Well, we fired all the officers and disciplined the men that were involved in the captain's schemes... Many of them had run away of their own, anyway."
    maya "我们解雇了所有参与船长阴谋的军官，并对那些参与其中的士兵进行了纪律处分……反正他们中许多人本来就是自己逃跑的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6158
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_406281c5:

    # maya "We're in the process of drafting citizens from the slums to form the new city guard. We're looking for idealistic men and women who want to make a change... Turns out we found plenty of volunteers."
    maya "我们正在从贫民窟招募市民组建新的城市卫队。我们正在寻找有理想、渴望改变现状的男男女女……结果发现我们找到了不少志愿者。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6161
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_c598d7f5:

    # maya "I seized all the assets that Farah had stolen and I gave half to the crown, which they were mighty happy about... Even though they are too conceited to show it."
    maya "我没收了法拉窃取的所有财产，并将一半上缴给了王室，他们对此非常高兴……尽管他们自负得不愿表现出来。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6164
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_7a42235e:

    # you "What about the other half?"
    you "另一半呢？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6166
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_e8f10401:

    # maya "It's going to go back to the slums, in the form of community projects and long-awaited improvements... Sanitizing the river and sewers, fixing the roads, building a proper hospital..."
    maya "它将以社区项目和期待已久的改善措施的形式回归贫民窟……例如，治理河流和下水道，修缮道路，建造一家像样的医院……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6169
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_473e43f3:

    # you "Wow, you aren't losing any time..."
    you "哇，你一点时间都没浪费……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6171
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_e52c9a96:

    # maya "Of course! We have our work cut out for us before we can turn this place around."
    maya "当然！在我们扭转这个地方的局面之前，还有很多工作要做。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6173
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_79c91bdd:

    # maya "Anyway, [MC.name]. There's something I ought to tell you..."
    maya "总之，[MC.name]，我有件事应该告诉你……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6175
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_a577ad0e:

    # you "What?"
    you "什么？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6177
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_a72d44a6:

    # maya "I've ordered a raid on your friends at the thieves guild."
    maya "我已经下令突袭你们盗贼公会的那些朋友。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6179
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_6ec22822:

    # "You're not sure how you're supposed to feel about this."
    "You're not sure how you're supposed to feel about this."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6181
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_0517df3c:

    # you "Well, they weren't my friends exactly..."
    you "嗯，他们严格来说并不算是我的朋友……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6183
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_bbc686b1:

    # maya "Anyway, you might be relieved to know that we only found a couple of vagrants and bare rooms there. They were long gone by the time we got there. But if you see them again... Tell them to stay out of my way."
    maya "总之，你或许会松一口气，因为我们只在那里发现了几个流浪汉和几间空荡荡的房间。我们到的时候他们早就走了。不过，如果你再见到他们……告诉他们别挡我的路。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6186
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_ad84d168:

    # you "Err, sure... Look, this is not why I came here."
    you "呃，当然……听着，我来这里不是为了这个。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6188
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_f7086792:

    # maya "Ah, yes, I know... You wanted to know about that license, right?"
    maya "啊，是的，我知道……你想了解的是那个驾照的事，对吧？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6190
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_8b661d26:

    # you "Yes. And my money. I've been through a lot to get this."
    you "是的。还有我的钱。我为了得到它付出了很多。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6192
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_81260057:

    # maya "Fine. Just this time, I'll dispense with the standard process. Here is your gold, and I'll sign your license immediately. You will be authorized to work within the city walls."
    maya "好吧。这次我就不走常规流程了。这是你的金子，我马上给你签许可证。你将被授权在城墙内工作。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6199
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_29da074f:

    # you "Thanks, that's great!"
    you "谢谢，太好了！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6201
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_1682cbed:

    # "You have got your [blist[2].cost] gold back."
    "You have got your [blist[2].cost] gold back."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6203
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_1f430069:

    # you "Say, can't you throw in a little extra? Like, giving me access to the noble quarters, and the court?"
    you "哎，能不能再多给点好处？比如，让我进出贵族府邸和宫廷？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6205
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_34ec0feb:

    # maya "Hey, you're greedy! Spent too much time with the thieves guild, haven't you?"
    maya "嘿，你太贪婪了！是不是在盗贼公会待得太久了？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6207
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_ad8ae482:

    # maya "I don't have the authority to handle access to the noble and royal quarters. This is beyond the city guard's jurisdiction."
    maya "我无权处理贵族和皇室住所的进出事宜。这超出了城卫队的管辖范围。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6209
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_e41e8ffa:

    # you "Aw... That sucks."
    you "啊……真糟糕。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6211
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_41a882fa:

    # maya "Perhaps you can make some new friends in high places? Having connections at court is sure to be useful for someone in your line of trade."
    maya "或许你可以在政界结交一些新朋友？对于你这行的人来说，在宫廷里有人脉肯定大有裨益。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6213
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_0bc31b93:

    # you "I'll think about it..."
    you "我会考虑一下……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6219
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_deb3c61d:

    # guard "You there! Stop!"
    guard "你！站住！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6229
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_d4bd098f:

    # roz "Hey! Stop right here!"
    roz "嘿！站住！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6238
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_f6e28ca7:

    # guard "Damn you! Everyone, get her!" with vpunch
    guard "Damn you! Everyone, get her!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6250
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_2ac106de:

    # roz "There! I've got you..." with vpunch
    roz "There! I've got you..." with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6256
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_d038ac92:

    # roz "HAAA!!! She bit me!!! That bitch!!!" with vpunch
    roz "HAAA!!! She bit me!!! That bitch!!!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6258
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_c6068518:

    # "Roz is a big guy, but it genuinely sounded like he was about to cry."
    "Roz is a big guy, but it genuinely sounded like he was about to cry."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6262
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_a1eea047:

    # "Maya opens the door and yells."
    "Maya opens the door and yells."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6264
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_d0dffeb8:

    # maya "What the hell is going on down there???" with vpunch
    maya "What the hell is going on down there???" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6266
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_89bb34b1:

    # "You hear Roz's voice coming from the lower floor."
    "You hear Roz's voice coming from the lower floor."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6268
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_f479c23b:

    # roz "Maya, we've captured a spy! Shit, what a fury... Tie her up and bring her to the captain upstairs!"
    roz "玛雅，我们抓到一个间谍！糟了，她真够凶的……把她绑起来，带到楼上去见船长！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6270
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_fc4fd754:

    # roz "AND DON'T LET HER OUT OF YOUR SIGHT FOR EVEN ONE MINUTE!"
    roz "哪怕一分钟也不要让她离开你的视线！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6278
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_91e36d18:

    # guard "Captain! We have intercepted a spy as she was trying to reach your quarters."
    guard "船长！我们截获了一名试图潜入您房间的间谍。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6280
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_381d4814:

    # "The guard shoves a bound woman down on the suite floor."
    "The guard shoves a bound woman down on the suite floor."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6289
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_b01ea08e:

    # renza "Let me go, you brute! I'm just an admirer of the captain... I wanted to pay my respects..."
    renza "放开我，你这畜生！我只是船长的仰慕者……我只是想表达我的敬意……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6291
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_10f11ea2:

    # "She gives you and Maya an ingenuous look."
    "She gives you and Maya an ingenuous look."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6293
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_cbc7bbca:

    # maya "Humph..."
    maya "哼..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6295
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_2efdf79c:

    # "She turns to the guard."
    "She turns to the guard."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6297
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_a2f8b290:

    # maya "Leave us."
    maya "离开我们。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6299
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_40144f2d:

    # guard "But, Captain, Roz said..."
    guard "但是，船长，罗兹说……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6301
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_ac9c640a:

    # maya "I said, 'Leave us'! She's tied up, what do you think is gonna happen? Get out." with vpunch
    maya "I said, 'Leave us'! She's tied up, what do you think is gonna happen? Get out." with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6303
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_2c71d790:

    # guard "Yes, my Lady."
    guard "是的，夫人。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6309
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_a121c7c6:

    # maya "Renza, I presume?"
    maya "我猜是伦扎吧？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6311
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_c3693205:

    # renza "Ah... So you know my name? [MC.name] ratted me out, didn't he."
    renza "啊……原来你知道我的名字？[MC.name]出卖了我，是吗？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6313
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_bf9c8578:

    # you "I didn't."
    you "我没有。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6315
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_0c449ec7:

    # maya "No, he didn't have to... I've been conducting my own inquiry into the thieves guild for a long time, and I have a whole file on its infamous leader: Renza the Black."
    maya "不，他不必……我长期以来一直在调查盗贼公会，我有一整份关于其臭名昭著的首领“黑衣伦扎”的档案。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6318
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_057a50c5:

    # renza "Well, I'm flattered. And I suppose I should be grateful that [MC.name] didn't betray me all the way."
    renza "嗯，我受宠若惊。我想我应该庆幸[MC.name]没有完全背叛我。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6320
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_9eacbc70:

    # "Maya scoffs."
    "Maya scoffs."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6322
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_7118b252:

    # maya "Betray you? Oh, come on... You're going to make us cry. Surely as a thief, you didn't expect people to behave any differently than you always do?"
    maya "背叛你们？哦，拜托……你们都要把我们弄哭了。作为一个窃贼，你们难道指望别人对你们的态度会和以往不同吗？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6325
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_ef8427c4:

    # renza "It's not like that!" with vpunch
    renza "It's not like that!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6327
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_4a3bb7be:

    # "Renza looks genuinely hurt."
    "Renza looks genuinely hurt."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6329
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_30a291eb:

    # renza "I lowered my guard around [MC.name], that was silly, I know. I shouldn't have."
    renza "我放松了对[MC.name]的警惕，我知道这很傻，我不应该那样做。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6331
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_55ac70e5:

    # renza "In fact, I wanted to have a word with him... That's why I came here."
    renza "事实上，我想和他谈谈……所以我才来的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6333
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_4907547d:

    # maya "A word with him! In the middle of a guard tower! That's rich."
    maya "跟他谈谈！就在岗楼中间！真是讽刺。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6335
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_8609fa7f:

    # renza "Come on, Captain. You have me cornered. I only request a moment with [MC.name]."
    renza "船长，请您别这样。您把我逼到角落了。我只请求和[MC.name]单独待一会儿。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6337
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_3c1ad4b2:

    # maya "Ha! You're under arrest in my own house, and I don't think I need to agree to any of your 'requests'."
    maya "哈！你现在是在我家被捕了，我想我没必要答应你的任何“要求”。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6339
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_b56016e2:

    # renza "But without me and my guild, you wouldn't be sitting where you are right now... At this very moment, you would be shining Farah's new pair of boots or something..."
    renza "但如果没有我和我的公会，你现在就不会坐在这里……此刻，你或许正在给法拉擦亮她的新靴子呢……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6342
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_bc7cc93d:

    # maya "Careful, Renza... *hiss*"
    maya "小心点，伦扎……*嘶*"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6344
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_8ba2f04c:

    # you "Look, Maya, she's got a point..."
    you "玛雅，你说的有道理……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6346
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_c2cf9e84:

    # renza "I'm only asking for a moment of privacy here. Compared to what I did for you, even unwillingly, it's a very small favor. Are you so dishonorable as to deny me this harmless request?"
    renza "我只是请求片刻的私人空间。与我为你做的那些事相比，即便我并非出于自愿，这也只是微不足道的小事。你竟如此不厚道，连我这无伤大雅的请求都不愿拒绝吗？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6349
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_ae577672:

    # maya "Dishonorable?" with vpunch
    maya "Dishonorable?" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6351
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_b05f94be:

    # "Maya's face reddens. She hates to have her honor questioned. You can tell Renza is playing on her weakness."
    "Maya's face reddens. She hates to have her honor questioned. You can tell Renza is playing on her weakness."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6353
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_f070531c:

    # maya "Hmph! Fine! You have 5 minutes with your boyfriend. Then, I'll have you locked up in the darkest cell until I interrogate you myself."
    maya "哼！行！你和你男朋友待五分钟。然后，我就把你关进最黑的牢房，亲自审问你。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6355
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_a0a737b3:

    # renza "Fine."
    renza "美好的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6357
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_131101df:

    # "Maya turns towards you."
    "Maya turns towards you."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6359
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_748acf57:

    # maya "And YOU, [MC.name]. Don't make any trouble, you hear me?"
    maya "还有你，[MC.name]。别惹麻烦，听见没？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6361
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_ed12f364:

    # you "S... Sure."
    you "嗯……当然。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6365
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_0ae9bcd0:

    # ""
    ""

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6367
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_902c3fae:

    # you "So... You came all the way here just to talk to me. I'm impressed."
    you "所以……你千里迢迢来这里就是为了跟我说话。我真是佩服你。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6369
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_0e66ba5d:

    # renza "Come on, don't flatter yourself, [MC.name]. I really came here to scout the captain's vault. I thought the party was a perfect occasion to infiltrate... Until I ran into this big, dumb guy."
    renza "别自作多情了，[MC.name]。我来这儿其实是想侦查船长的宝库。我以为这场派对是潜入的绝佳机会……直到我碰上了这个又大又笨的家伙。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6372
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_abe9b8c6:

    # renza "Well, he's fast for his size, I'll give him that!"
    renza "嗯，就他这个体型来说，速度确实很快，这一点我得承认！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6374
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_e1b1a2d1:

    # you "I've got bad news for you. The vault is empty now. Maya has already sent the gold away to improve life for people in the slums."
    you "我有个坏消息要告诉你。金库空了。玛雅已经把黄金送去改善贫民窟居民的生活了。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6376
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_566b10ca:

    # renza "What?" with vpunch
    renza "What?" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6378
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_c1a252a9:

    # renza "Damn that tomboy do-gooder! She really did her best to foil all of my plans. And you, [MC.name]..."
    renza "该死的假小子！她真是煞费苦心地破坏我的所有计划。还有你，[MC.name]……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6380
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_03eee5aa:

    # you "Oh come on, Renza, don't lecture me. I couldn't just let you take over the slums."
    you "哎呀，伦扎，别跟我说教了。我总不能让你接管贫民窟吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6382
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_28519141:

    # you "People have had enough being robbed and threatened. Maya will help them. The slums and its inhabitants will be better for it."
    you "人们受够了被抢劫和威胁。玛雅会帮助他们。贫民窟及其居民的生活也会因此而改善。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6385
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_8750ea27:

    # "Renza looks bitter."
    "Renza looks bitter."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6387
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_62486448:

    # renza "Just my luck. I had to run into the one bleeding-heart pimp in the whole of Xeros!"
    renza "真是倒霉透了。我居然碰上了Xeros城里唯一一个心软的皮条客！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6389
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_21210b3d:

    # you "Maya told me your people made it out before she raided the thieves guild. You haven't lost everything."
    you "玛雅告诉我，在她袭击盗贼公会之前，你们的人已经逃出来了。你们并没有失去一切。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6391
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_6893106a:

    # renza "Ha! Did you think the thieves guild was that weak? Even if I fall, others will be lining up to take my place."
    renza "哈！你以为盗贼公会就这么弱吗？就算我倒下了，也会有人排着队来接替我的位置。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6393
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_bff59177:

    # "She lowers her voice."
    "She lowers her voice."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6395
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_94c751ed:

    # renza "But listen, [MC.name]. I'm not eager to end up locked in Maya's prison. I helped you, so you owe me."
    renza "但是听着，[MC.name]。我可不想最后被关进玛雅的监狱。我帮过你，所以你欠我的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6397
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_c9ce2f7c:

    # renza "Help me get out of here."
    renza "救救我，让我离开这里。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6399
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_92c9eb82:

    # you "What???" with vpunch
    you "What???" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6401
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_310b7511:

    # renza "Please, [MC.name], pretty please? I helped you a great deal, then you wronged me. Ruined months of planning. Sent the poor Lydie to a dank cell, you did! Are you also going to send me to rot in jail until I'm old and grey?"
    renza "求求你了，[MC.name]？我帮了你那么多，你却这样对我。毁了我几个月的计划。你还把可怜的莉迪关进了阴暗潮湿的牢房！你是不是也要把我送进监狱，直到我老死？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6404
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_10b654a9:

    # you "But..."
    you "但..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6406
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_344837c8:

    # renza "If you help me now, I'll call us even. I'll even let you visit the thieves guild, for old times sake, in spite of all that happened. Clean slate. Think about it."
    renza "如果你现在帮我，我们就扯平了。就算过去发生过那么多事，为了报答旧谊，我甚至会让你去盗贼公会走一趟。一切重新开始。好好想想吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6409
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_dae0ec55:

    # you "..."
    you "..."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6412
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_2dfaa7bf:

    # you "..." nointeract
    you "..." nointeract

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6416
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_211cc726:

    # you "Well, I suppose I owe you for trashing up your plans. But don't go backstabbing me for my trouble later on, okay?"
    you "好吧，我想我应该感谢你打乱了我的计划。但以后别因为我给你添麻烦就背后捅我一刀，好吗？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6420
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_3970fbc8:

    # renza "No, I won't. Thank you, [MC.name]. You're a gentleman."
    renza "不，我不会。谢谢你，[MC.name]。你真是个绅士。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6422
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_adae3550:

    # you "I don't know what the hell I am doing..."
    you "我真不知道自己在干什么……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6424
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_9d61debb:

    # "You untie the bounds around Renza's arms and legs."
    "You untie the bounds around Renza's arms and legs."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6426
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_3b00845d:

    # renza "Thanks."
    renza "谢谢。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6430
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_4f34a3eb:

    # "In a flash, Renza takes out her dagger and holds it to your throat." with vpunch
    "In a flash, Renza takes out her dagger and holds it to your throat." with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6432
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_2b8cb7b0:

    # you "Hey!!! I though we said, 'no backstabbing'!"
    you "嘿！！！我们不是说过“不许背后捅刀”吗！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6434
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_99ef43c1:

    # renza "Well, technically this isn't your back..."
    renza "嗯，严格来说，这并不是你的背……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6436
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_dcf7b1ad:

    # "The cold blade feels chilling against your throat. Beads of sweat form on your forehead."
    "The cold blade feels chilling against your throat. Beads of sweat form on your forehead."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6438
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_7b8d7d4c:

    # you "Listen, Renza..."
    you "听着，伦扎……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6446
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_1005dc94:

    # "Using the hilt of her dagger, Renza viciously punches you in the nose."
    "Using the hilt of her dagger, Renza viciously punches you in the nose."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6448
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_a42f719b:

    # you "Ouch! What was that for!"
    you "哎哟！你干嘛！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6452
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_68ffd60c:

    # "You hold your bloody nose as Renza sheathes her dagger, laughing."
    "You hold your bloody nose as Renza sheathes her dagger, laughing."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6454
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_58343e65:

    # renza "That... was the price for betraying me. Also, this is your cover story, for when the guards break in."
    renza "这就是背叛我的代价。还有，这是你用来搪塞守卫闯入的说辞。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6456
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_4b97a285:

    # "Blowing you a kiss, she leaps to the nearest window and leans through it."
    "Blowing you a kiss, she leaps to the nearest window and leans through it."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6462
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_55650cc3:

    # "Nursing your bleeding nose, you begrudgingly admire her fearlessness as she disappears from your sight, climbing her way down in spite of the heights."
    "Nursing your bleeding nose, you begrudgingly admire her fearlessness as she disappears from your sight, climbing her way down in spite of the heights."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6465
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_4977f9a8:

    # you "That Renza... She's a fierce one."
    you "那个伦扎……她可真够厉害的。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6473
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_92362947:

    # maya "[MC.name]! What the hell happened... Where is Renza???"
    maya "[MC.name]！到底发生了什么……伦扎在哪儿？？？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6475
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_5932c309:

    # "She takes in the whole scene: the open window, the untied ropes on the floor, your bleeding face... She gives you a furious look."
    "She takes in the whole scene: the open window, the untied ropes on the floor, your bleeding face... She gives you a furious look."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6477
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_9082aab4:

    # you "Look, she managed to free herself and attack me. I couldn't do anything..."
    you "你看，她挣脱了束缚，然后攻击我。我什么也做不了……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6479
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_1b5cd112:

    # maya "Oh, save it! *mad*" with vpunch
    maya "Oh, save it! *mad*" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6481
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_432edc40:

    # maya "Men, stop partying and form a patrol! Go after her, all of you!"
    maya "男人们，别聚会了，快组成巡逻队！都去追她！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6483
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_e35fad61:

    # maya "Damn you, [MC.name]... I thought I could trust you!"
    maya "该死的，[MC.name]……我以为我可以信任你！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6489
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_cd61cc23:

    # "You've managed to salvage a bit of your reputation with Renza and the thieves guild. Your reputation with the city guard has been damaged, however."
    "You've managed to salvage a bit of your reputation with Renza and the thieves guild. Your reputation with the city guard has been damaged, however."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6498
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_b48aacce:

    # you "Sorry Renza. I'll sleep better knowing you're behind bars."
    you "对不起，伦扎。知道你被关进监狱，我才能睡得更安稳。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6502
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_40f6d3ba:

    # renza "What! Fuck you, you bastard! I'll get you!" with vpunch
    renza "What! Fuck you, you bastard! I'll get you!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6508
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_e70d5953:

    # maya "Come on, Renza, I thought you wanted a friendly talk..."
    maya "拜托，伦扎，我还以为你想跟我好好聊聊呢……"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6512
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_479d74ea:

    # renza "Damn you, [MC.name]! Damn you all to hell!!!" with vpunch
    renza "Damn you, [MC.name]! Damn you all to hell!!!" with vpunch

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6514
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_2bcfb768:

    # maya "Mmmh... It looks like your little chat didn't go as well as you had planned. Men, take her."
    maya "嗯……看来你们的小小聊天并没有像你计划的那样顺利。男人们，把她带走吧。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6518
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_08b22f56:

    # renza "Arrrh!!!"
    renza "啊！！！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6522
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_bd7b0d9c:

    # maya "I'm happy to see that you are not too cosy with the thieves, [MC.name]. Keep on walking in the light, and Arios will wash away your sins."
    maya "很高兴看到你没有和盗贼们走得太近，[MC.name]。继续走在光明中，阿里奥斯会洗净你的罪孽。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6526
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_maya_84e5bf9f:

    # "Your reputation with the city guard has increased. However, you have lost access to the thieves guild for good."
    "Your reputation with the city guard has increased. However, you have lost access to the thieves guild for good."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6551
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_lieutenant_8b9c3f2b:

    # guard "Hey! If it isn't [MC.name]. Came here to celebrate with us?"
    guard "嘿！这不是[MC.name]吗？来和我们一起庆祝的？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6553
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_lieutenant_68590058:

    # "You recognize many faces around the camp. You have seen those men hanging around the thieves guild. Even though they are now wearing guard uniforms, they look out of place somehow."
    "You recognize many faces around the camp. You have seen those men hanging around the thieves guild. Even though they are now wearing guard uniforms, they look out of place somehow."

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6556
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_lieutenant_32b6dad3:

    # you "Evening. I'm looking for lieuten... I mean, captain Lydie."
    you "晚上好。我在找中尉……我是说，莉迪上尉。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6558
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_lieutenant_655ef585:

    # guard "She's up in the captain suite, sampling some of Farah's fancy champagne reserve, no doubt!"
    guard "她肯定在船长套房里，品尝着法拉珍藏的高级香槟！"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6560
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_lieutenant_cc263b82:

    # you "Thanks."
    you "谢谢。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6572
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_lieutenant_0215bf20:

    # lieutenant "Yes?"
    lieutenant "是的？"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6578
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_lieutenant_8f27130c:

    # you "It's me."
    you "这就是我。"

# game/BKchapter1.rpy:6580
translate chinese_simplified c1_ending_lieutenant_e86e6b1e:

    # lieutenant "Oh, [MC.name]! How lovely of you to pay me a visit."
    lieutenant "哦，[MC.name]！你来探望我真是太好了。"

